<title>UK: Deutsche Apotheker sets 300 mln mark 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Apotheker sets 300 mln mark 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank and Apobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE APOTHEKER-UND AERZTEBANK EG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +12.5 BP  PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.96     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
